## Interface: 120100, 120105
## Title: XayaUI Game Data Capture
## Notes: Separate debugging tool for XayaUI. Pulls every class, spec, talent, spell description, spellbook entry, gear and set-bonus line the game will give an addon, and records which auras each cast causes (with observed durations). Opens from XayaUI > Settings > Debugging or with /xuidump.
